{"synopsis":"SeoJoon yang telah bekerja menabung untuk melunasi hutang orang tuanya yang telah meninggal dan untuk mengikuti Hunter Academy akhirnya harus menghabiskan semua tabungannya untuk operasi karena kecelakaan\nDi saat dia sedang berputus asa sebuah iklan muncul di handphone nya\nAnda juga bisa menjadi seorang awakener\nDia memutuskan untuk mengikuti iklan tersebut karena dia sudah merasa nothing to lose\nTuan Kim SeoJoon selamat datang di Akademi Transcension\nHunter Academy ini berada pada dimensi yang berbeda dari akademi pemburu lainnya.","alternative_title":"초월자 학원의 수강생이 되었다 | I Became a Student at the Transcension Academy","author":"Dupachitapa (두파치타파), Eojjeoda (어쩌다)","artist":"Kkyujanneu (뀨잔느)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"41a46a4f-247d-4a17-ad28-9bf140629f8b","number":"205","chapter":"205","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"5af95dbc-1277-4880-96f5-7c4650e3dc77","number":"204","chapter":"204","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"94aeda88-7e74-4ac1-a7c0-fdbb8b712c91","number":"203","chapter":"203","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"7f889824-18ab-4703-8e44-1c3dd4b2a518","number":"202","chapter":"202","title":"","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"e462f1c2-0e5b-449a-805f-740e1b13d3bc","number":"201","chapter":"201","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"d26b0475-599a-4554-a49a-815808278bd5","number":"200","chapter":"200","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"e13a57ec-6b5a-4ef4-9517-06890f64b4e1","number":"199","chapter":"199","title":"","date":"2026-05-31","released":"2026-05-31"},{"chapter_id":"dbd34e84-fc97-483b-9c1a-575ae8d85ad6","number":"198","chapter":"198","title":"","date":"2026-05-25","released":"2026-05-25"},{"chapter_id":"9c7e7123-7666-407c-bda3-e456c9786adc","number":"197","chapter":"197","title":"","date":"2026-05-25","released":"2026-05-25"},{"chapte